stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> captured
    captured --> extractionQueued: queue
    captured --> reviewed: review (manual entry)
    extractionQueued --> extracting: start
    extractionQueued --> reviewed: review
    extracting --> needsReview: succeed
    extracting --> extractionFailed: fail
    extracting --> extractionQueued: interrupt
    needsReview --> reviewed: review
    needsReview --> extractionQueued: rerun
    reviewed --> extractionQueued: rerun
    extractionFailed --> extractionQueued: retry
    extractionFailed --> reviewed: review
